		<questManager>
			<quests>
				<li>
					<name>The Hunted Baron</name>
					<appearanceTick>480000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>490351</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>109648</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>Thing_Human1068</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>542851</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Petronas Takamu&lt;/color&gt;, a baron of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. His guards were killed in an ambush. He escaped, but is now being followed by (*Threat)a manhunting goose(/Threat).

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Petronas&lt;/color&gt; wants you to keep him safe at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt; for a few hours until his shuttle can come pick him up.

He will bestow 8 honor on whoever accepts this quest. This is enough honor to receive the royal title of Yeoman, and all benefits that come with it - including the first level of psychic powers.</description>
					<root>Intro_Wimp</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>1</id>
					<name>Lynx's Yeoman Ceremony</name>
					<appearanceTick>542851</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>543292</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>599558</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>546635</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; is ready to grant &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lynx&lt;/color&gt; the title of yeoman and the power of a level 1 psylink in a bestowing ceremony.

The bestower will arrive by shuttle and perform the ceremony.

The bestower will only give a title if any throneroom requirements are satisfied.

You can betray the bestower to steal psylink neuroformers, but this will make &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; your enemy.

If you miss or fail this ceremony, there will be another opportunity later. If the bestower or guards are harmed for any reason, there will be diplomatic consequences.</description>
					<root>BestowingCeremony</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>2</id>
					<name>Ship to the Stars</name>
					<appearanceTick>1200000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1200000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>4</challengeRating>
					<description>A friendly AI from your past named (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) has sent you a message!

He reveals that he has a starship hidden on this planet, and sends you its world coordinates.

The starship is in deep hibernation mode. You'll have to start it up when you arrive, then defend it from raiders trying to steal it until the startup sequence completes. It will be a long, difficult series of battles.

If you can get the ship off the ground, (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) will take you off this rimworld, to the stars.</description>
					<root>EndGame_ShipEscape</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts>
						<li Class="QuestPart_Choice">
							<inSignalChoiceUsed>Quest2.escapeShip.LaunchedShip</inSignalChoiceUsed>
							<choices>
								<li>
									<questParts />
									<rewards>
										<li Class="Reward_PassageOffworld" />
									</rewards>
								</li>
							</choices>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_SpawnWorldObject">
							<inSignal>Quest2.Initiate</inSignal>
							<spawned>True</spawned>
							<defsToExcludeFromHyperlinks IsNull="True" />
