					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>5776814</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; is ready to grant &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bishop&lt;/color&gt; the title of yeoman and the power of a level 1 psylink in a bestowing ceremony.

The bestower will arrive by shuttle and perform the ceremony.

The bestower will only give a title if any throneroom requirements are satisfied.

You can betray the bestower to steal psylink neuroformers, but this will make &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt; your enemy.

If you miss or fail this ceremony, there will be another opportunity later. If the bestower or guards are harmed for any reason, there will be diplomatic consequences.</description>
